{
  "explanation": "The attacker at source IP 10.0.0.77 systematically targeted sensitive internal data resources, utilizing tools like rclone, custom Python scripts, and Wget to extract large volumes of customer records, PII including SSNs, and a full database backup. The HTTP 200 status codes across all requests indicate that these unauthorized data extraction attempts were successful, resulting in the exfiltration of gigabytes of sensitive data.",
  "mitre_tactic": "Exfiltration",
  "recommended_actions": [
    "Immediately isolate the source IP/host 10.0.0.77 from the network to prevent further data access.",
    "Revoke and rotate any compromised API keys, database credentials, or service accounts associated with the activity.",
    "Implement rate limiting and strict pagination controls on API endpoints to prevent mass data harvesting."
  ]
}
